OL,3,AHuel ad banned for suggesting its
OL,4,Aproducts could replace all meals
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn advert for Huel meal replacement
OL,7,Fshakes has been banned by the
OL,8,Fadvertising watchdog for encouraging or
OL,9,Fcondoning "irresponsible" dietary
OL,10,Fpractices.
OL,12,FThe ad featured Huel brand ambassador
OL,13,FSpencer Matthews sharing an anecdote of
OL,14,Fa person he met who "only eats Huel"
OL,15,Fand who won a 260km race "by miles".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,119,105,200,300,0,100
