OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHuel ad banned for suggesting its
OL,4,Aproducts could replace all meals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Advertising Standards Authority
OL,7,F(ASA) said that viewers could assume
OL,8,Ffrom the ad that replacing all
OL,9,Fconventional food with Huel was
OL,10,F"nutritionally appropriate" and was
OL,11,Fcompatible with elite physical
OL,12,Fperformance.
OL,14,FHuel said Matthews' anecdote was not "a
OL,15,Frecommendation or instruction" and the
OL,16,Fpurpose of the ad was to challenge the
OL,17,Fmisconception that Huel could replace
OL,18,Fevery meal".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
